{"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Mohammed Shehzad\\Documents\\Mo Digital Portfolio\\mo-portfolio-v2\\assets\\documents\\Mohammed_Shehzad_Khan_CV.docx", "content": {"_header": {"_text": "Mohammed Shehzad Khan - International Primary EAL Educator\n\nZhengzhou, China\nmdshezkhn@gmail.com\n+86-131 3771 9002\nlinkedin.com/in/mdshezkhn\\nmdshezkhn.github.io/mo-portfolio-v2/\n","font_size": 12, "font_family": \"Calibri\"}, "_body": {"_text": "11+ years of international primary education across India and China, specialising in English as an Additional Language instruction for multilingual learners in Years 1–6. Holding a Postgraduate Certificate in Education (PGCE) from the University of Cumbria, with demonstrated capacity in cross-curricular STEM facilitation, teacher mentoring, quality assurance, and professional development design. Evidence-informed practitioner whose PGCE research on dialogic teaching and questioning strategies has directly improved participation equity in bilingual classrooms.", "font_size": 11}, "_footer": {"_text": "Confidential document – Copyright 2026 Mohammed Shehzad Khan\nAll formatting optimized for recruiter review and print compatibility"}}}}]